To generate the assert statement for the given comment, we need to ensure that for every index `i` greater than the given index and less than the size of the list, the element at index `i` remains unchanged. We can use the `\forall` quantifier to express this condition.

Here is the assert statement:

<code>assert \forall int i; index < i && i < \old(this.size()); this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>

